    {
      "id": "OdrOvWMfd1A-PwgHp_et1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 251.5,
      "y": 825.5,
      "width": 634,
      "height": 650,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 402747182,
      "version": 750,
      "versionNonce": 1056751726,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791868022754,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1). Omega -> Minimum time required by an algorithm for all input\nvalues .\n\n It represent the best case of an algorithm time complexity .\n\n2). Theata -> It indicates the average bound of an algorithm .\n\nIt represents the average time complexity of an algorithm .\n\n3). Big O -> Represent the maximum time required by an\nalgorithm for all agorithm .\n\n\n\n** When number of instruction remain constant while changing\nthe input size then the complexity is said to be O(1) .\n\n\n** When number of instruction execute as the size of input\nthen the complexity is said to be O (n) .\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1). Omega -> Minimum time required by an algorithm for all input values .\n\n It represent the best case of an algorithm time complexity .\n\n2). Theata -> It indicates the average bound of an algorithm .\n\nIt represents the average time complexity of an algorithm .\n\n3). Big O -> Represent the maximum time required by an algorithm for all agorithm .\n\n\n\n** When number of instruction remain constant while changing the input size then the complexity is said to be O(1) .\n\n\n** When number of instruction execute as the size of input then the complexity is said to be O (n) .\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
